    "detailed_description": "Keep the house warm as long as possible in this endless survival against the winter!<br />\r\nThe outside temperature lowers every day!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf the inside temperature goes below 10\u00b0C the pipes will freeze!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKeep filling the heater with woodchips while also managing your hunger.<br />\r\nIf the ashes overfill the inside temperature starts to drop.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSet the heat, order more woodchips and upgrade the house insulation from the control panel<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFinding bread or fish automatically gives you money and relieves your hunger. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWays to earn money:<br />\r\nEvery day you get money based on the inside temperature!<br />\r\nFinding bread from the woodchips gives a random amount of money!<br />\r\nIce fishing gives money based on fishing experience! <br />\r\nAfter day 18 you can start investing in the stock market!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPower-ups:<br />\r\nWhen you reach day 10 and 20, you get to choose 1 of 5 power-ups.<br />\r\nFishing speed - Boosts your fishing speed<br />\r\nPickup speed - Move woodchips  and clean the ashes faster <br />\r\nBread % - Boosts your chance to find bread<br />\r\n$2000 - instant +$2000<br />\r\nDaily money - Boosts the amount of money you get based on the inside temperature<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose your power-ups wisely, manage your resources and time to survive as long as possible!",
    "about_the_game": "Keep the house warm as long as possible in this endless survival against the winter!<br />\r\nThe outside temperature lowers every day!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf the inside temperature goes below 10\u00b0C the pipes will freeze!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKeep filling the heater with woodchips while also managing your hunger.<br />\r\nIf the ashes overfill the inside temperature starts to drop.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSet the heat, order more woodchips and upgrade the house insulation from the control panel<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFinding bread or fish automatically gives you money and relieves your hunger. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWays to earn money:<br />\r\nEvery day you get money based on the inside temperature!<br />\r\nFinding bread from the woodchips gives a random amount of money!<br />\r\nIce fishing gives money based on fishing experience! <br />\r\nAfter day 18 you can start investing in the stock market!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPower-ups:<br />\r\nWhen you reach day 10 and 20, you get to choose 1 of 5 power-ups.<br />\r\nFishing speed - Boosts your fishing speed<br />\r\nPickup speed - Move woodchips  and clean the ashes faster <br />\r\nBread % - Boosts your chance to find bread<br />\r\n$2000 - instant +$2000<br />\r\nDaily money - Boosts the amount of money you get based on the inside temperature<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose your power-ups wisely, manage your resources and time to survive as long as possible!",
